# --- Unverified parked code (see backend/_phase_staging/README.md) ----------
# Generated during the rejected one-pass implementation. Kept on disk, kept out
# of the tree and out of Git until each module is re-introduced with passing
# tests in its own phase. The README stays committed so the reason is recorded.
backend/_phase_staging/**
!backend/_phase_staging/README.md

